     the top margin, ending 1 in from the left edge (typst line-numbers); a single rule 14 pt left of the text (page
     border; typst pleading-rule). The last section: letter page, top and bottom margins 1 in (27 lines of 24 pt), left
     1.5 in, right 1 in; the page number centered in a 14 pt line box 36.75 pt above the page foot (footer 735 twips:
     where typst sets it, footer-descent 30 %; LR 9004(b)). docx/nvb-adversary-complaint.lua writes every paragraph's own
     spacing. Twips: 20 x pt. pandoc-from: no fancy lists, so a typed marker such as "(a)(1)" in a quotation stays text. -->
